- **Authorization gap.** `PATCH /accounts/:id` and `PATCH /orders/:id/cancel` never check that the caller owns the row, so any logged-in user can change any account or cancel any order. The audit will record these writes accurately but won't prevent them. Fix this before treating the trail as evidence.
